适用范围与排除项 / Scope and Exclusions

The MIT grant above covers all original material created by this project's
authors: the Python tools under tools/, the documentation (SKILL.md, README.md,
references/, smallmodel/, CHANGELOG.md), evals/, and the scenario / example
data authored here.

It does NOT cover material owned by Hypergryph Network Technology Co., Ltd.
("Hypergryph") or any other third party. Excluded from the MIT grant:

1. Game titles, names and terminology ("Arknights", "Integrated Strategies",
   "Black Stream Sea of Trees" / 明日方舟 / 集成战略 / 黑流树海), in-game node
   names, item names and any text taken from the game.
2. Game screenshots and other game-derived imagery, including every PNG file
   under tools/examples/ (scene-*.png, glyph-*.png, badge-*.png).
3. The game's rules, mechanics and numerical values as such. The authors' own
   descriptions of them are MIT-licensed; the underlying game content is not.

Within references/, these same elements (game names and terminology, node and
item names, and the numerical values themselves) are likewise excluded from the
MIT grant, while the prose, chapter structure, tables and derivation method
authored here remain MIT. See references/LICENSE.md for the itemized split.

Such material is included only for identification, documentation and
interoperability purposes, is not sublicensed here, and is used on a
non-endorsement basis. If you redistribute this repository, keep this notice
intact and do not state or imply that Hypergryph endorses or licenses it.

Third-party dependencies (Pillow, numpy, scipy, rapidocr_onnxruntime,
onnxruntime, and others) are distributed under their own licenses and are not
covered by this file.
